<h1>Addresses in the lists</h1>
<p>Addresses belong to a named appearance and historical date. Residence and office addresses are kept separately. Orange points are modern geocoding candidates awaiting review; they do not establish where a historical building stood. Coordinates are calculated along modern street address ranges.</p>
<p><a href="/data/addresses.csv" download>Download addresses and geocoding results (CSV)</a> · <a href="/map/">Town and city map</a> · <a href="https://geocoding.geo.census.gov/geocoder/Geocoding_Services_API.html">US Census geocoding method</a></p>
